# Binary files must never go through end-of-line conversion.
#
# `git add` on backend/scripts/demo_assets/esign/*.pdf warned "LF will be
# replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it". For a PDF that is corruption,
# not a formatting preference: the bytes change, so the sha256 changes, and
# `sign_documents.file_hash` is pinned to the sha256 of these exact files by
# backend/scripts/place_demo_esign_pdfs.py. A checkout on another machine would
# silently produce documents whose stored hash no longer describes them.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.mp4   binary
